# Source of scripts/ci/requirements-mutmut.txt (hash-locked with pip-compile). The only tool
# here is mutmut, which mutation-tests the Python CI helpers in this directory (#161, ADR 0007).
# It is CI tooling only: nothing of it is shipped and the helpers stay standard-library only.
# Dependabot (pip, /scripts/ci) updates this pair. CONTRIBUTING.md, "Mutation testing of the
# Python CI helpers", has the license check and the update steps.
mutmut==3.8.1
